{#- The "<brand> homeowner calls" contact card (T199; BIZ-046, CALL-017, D-344, D-359): the name,
    exactly the current masked pool numbers, the BIZ-046 line. Values arrive vCard-escaped from
    `business_portal::contact_card`, which also turns the line ends into CRLF. No business or
    homeowner number is ever here. -#}
BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
FN:{{ name }}
N:{{ name }};;;;
{% for n in numbers %}TEL;TYPE=VOICE:{{ n }}
{% endfor %}NOTE:{{ note }}
END:VCARD
